            <link>https://stillread.app</link>
            <sparkle:version>30</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.1.0</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Tabs, for when one window is enough.</p>
<ul>
<li>Turn on &quot;Open files and folders in tabs&quot; in Settings → Windows, and opening a new file or folder joins your current window as a tab instead of opening a new one</li>
<li>Drag a tab out to give it its own window, and merge windows back together from the Window menu</li>
<li>Off by default: nothing changes unless you turn it on</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
