            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.3</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<p>Better handling of images.</p>
<ul>
<li>Images that can&#x27;t be found now show their description in a quiet caption instead of an empty box.</li>
<li>Images with site-root paths like /images/photo.jpg now load from your project&#x27;s public folder (Astro, Laravel, Next and similar).</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
